---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AdBanner from '../components/AdBanner.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
    <div class="glass-panel" style="padding: 2rem;">
      <h1 class="h2 text-gradient" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">About DDU MATERIAL</h1>
      
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        Welcome to DDU MATERIAL! This platform is built specifically for DDU students to make finding, organizing, and studying course materials as frictionless as possible. We provide a massive, curated library of study resources.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">📚 What You Can Find Here</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        No more digging through messy WhatsApp groups to find that one PYQ from two years ago. We have meticulously organized everything by semester and subject, including:
        <ul style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          <li><strong>Handwritten & Typed Notes:</strong> High-quality notes from top students.</li>
          <li><strong>Previous Year Questions (PYQs):</strong> Essential for exam preparation.</li>
          <li><strong>Lab Manuals & Assignments:</strong> Complete references for your practicals.</li>
          <li><strong>Syllabus & Books:</strong> Official university syllabus and recommended reading.</li>
        </ul>
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">✨ Platform Features</h2>
      
      <div style="display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            <span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">📦</span>
            <strong style="color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.1rem;">Download Files & Folders</strong>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
            You can download individual files directly, or if you need an entire subject's notes, simply <strong>Right-Click</strong> (or <strong>Long-Press</strong> on your phone) on any folder to open a Context Menu and download everything inside as a single ZIP file!
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            <span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">🖥️</span>
            <strong style="color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.1rem;">Full-Screen PDF Viewer</strong>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
            Click on any file to open our custom PDF viewer right in your browser. You can toggle <strong>Full-Screen Mode</strong> for a completely distraction-free study session without needing to download the file first.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            <span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">💬</span>
            <strong style="color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.1rem;">Discuss & Comment</strong>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
            Stuck on a difficult PYQ problem? Every single file on DDU MATERIAL has a dedicated comments section. Log in to ask questions, help others, and discuss the material directly on the page!
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            <span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">🌙</span>
            <strong style="color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.1rem;">OLED Dark Mode & Smart Search</strong>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">
            Studying late? Click the Moon icon in the top header to switch to an eye-friendly dark theme. Looking for something specific? Click the search bar to reveal an advanced <strong>Semester Filter</strong>!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🤝 Help the Community</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        This platform runs on community contributions. If you have handwritten notes, old sessional papers, or lab manuals that aren't on the site yet, please consider donating them!
      </p>
      
      <a href="/contribute" class="btn btn-primary" style="display: inline-flex; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;">
        Contribute Material
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8">
      <AdBanner />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
